g behavior survived reboot on all nodes"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Real topology discovery (node1 routes node2<->node3, not the flat default net initially observed)","command_ids":["cmd-c298c72c62364009","cmd-769958c201434e4e","cmd-8055a54b46104544","cmd-9aea39cabd2341e4","cmd-1a9741ff85aa4e02","cmd-303d6dbceaba4a16","cmd-dd194042090046e0"],"summary":"Confirmed node1 has 3 NICs (eth0/eth1/eth2) and node2/node3 each have an unconfigured eth1; firewalld showed eth1 present, revealing the intended private-network topology"},{"requirement":"Static addressing and routing configured so node2<->node3 traffic actually transits node1","command_ids":["cmd-818da2a9680a4289","cmd-38fff8e2c395429d","cmd-34f4226c385743df","cmd-fd4a47155c52454e","cmd-d9020ba59781448d","cmd-2cd1e75f7b0f4c32","cmd-af123df2cdbc4389"],"summary":"Assigned IPs on node1 eth1/eth2, node2/node3 eth1, added static routes; ping node2->node3 showed TTL=63 confirming one-hop routing via node1"},{"requirement":"Baseline (unshaped) throughput in both directions","command_ids":["cmd-61e6aab2810e4d92","cmd-f2f4723c61c44d23"],"summary":"iperf3 measured ~21.7 Gbit/s node2->node3 and ~21.6 Gbit/s node3->node2 before any shaping was applied"},{"requirement":"Apply 1 Mbit/s limit on node2->node3 traffic only, leaving node3->node2 unrestricted","command_ids":["cmd-f8e306b816df4193","cmd-463728a543ef49dc","cmd-88f6b291540047b1","cmd-bdebfff8b8a84904"],"summary":"Configured VyOS QoS shaper (bandwidth/ceiling 1mbit) as egress on node1 eth2 (node3-facing interface); tc class show confirmed 'rate 1Mbit ceil 1Mbit'; iperf3 showed node2->node3 throttled to ~1.13 Mbit/s while node3->node2 stayed at ~1.54 Gbit/s"},{"requirement":"Node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity, recovered state (QoS shaping, forwarding)","command_ids":["cmd-da9b4e8f92134589","cmd-be25f5d629354eca","cmd-33ea4573a1004215","cmd-c897a1af85ef40b2","cmd-fb84b8b80b174c88","cmd-9f7437deddc34157"],"summary":"Captured bas